# Play test of the Coral Observatory (CIPlay coral_observatory, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the
# ring's east shore (about 4 m), the footbridge (2-2.9 m) to the floating deck (2 m) in the lagoon (3.3 m deep), the
# blue hole in the lagoon's west part.
island Coral Observatory
expect step 0
expect title The Reef Remembers

# From the ring's east shore along the footbridge onto the observatory's deck
walk 60 0.4 to 56 0.4 to 30 0.4 to 14 0.4 to 8 0 h=2
zone station
expect step 1
read Director's log
expect step 2
open Dive locker
expect story casekey 1
expect step 3

# The cases are locked without the key card - with it, the lagoon's two open; the edge's is guarded
expect stand 0 0 h=2
zone edge
expect message a light moves
kill Angler fish
expect step 4
open Garden sample case A
open Garden sample case B
open Blue hole sample case C
expect story sample 3
expect step 5

# The analyzer takes the three samples: its light comes on and the director's safe opens
use analyzer
expect message dying of cold
expect shown analyzerlight
expect story sample 0
open Director's safe
expect item Blueprint_Recycler 1
expect done
